    "sections": {
        "description": "The BPO Services Theme is designed with a structured layout suitable for presenting business process services, company information, and operational details. It includes responsive page sections that adapt across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. The theme supports customizable banners, service sections, team profiles, testimonials, contact forms, and call-to-action areas for organized content presentation. Built with clean code and standard customization options, the theme allows changes to colors, typography, images, and layout settings through the customizer. It is compatible with popular plugins for contact forms, SEO management, and social media integration. The homepage includes multiple content blocks for displaying service categories, workflow information, and client-related content. Additional features include blog support, navigation menus, footer widgets, and fast-loading page structures. The overall design focuses on readability, organized content placement, and flexible section management for different business-related websites."
    },
